    <statement><p>Simplify the expression 
<me>\frac{x^2+7 x+10}{x^2+7 x+6}\cdot
\frac{x^2+4 x+3}{x^2+8 x+12}</me> 
and give your answer in the form of
<me>\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}.</me></p>
<p>Your answer for the function <m>f(x)</m> is : <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Your answer for the function <m>g(x)</m> is : <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(x+5\right)\mathopen{}\left(x+3\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(x+6\right)\mathopen{}\left(x+6\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
